\title{Fredrik Bakke}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\meta{author}{false}

\p{
I am a PhD student at the [[ntnu]], doing work in higher category theory and
univalent type theory, supervised by [[runehaugseng]] and co-supervised by
[[ulrikbuchholtz]]. I am a collaborator on the [[agda-synthetic-categories]] project
and a maintainer of [[agda-unimath]].
}

\p{
This is my personal site where I share notes as well as miscellaneous exposition
related to my work. The web page is written using [Jon Sterling](jonsterling)'s
[Forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/005P/). The forest is hosted in a
[public GitHub repository](https://github.com/fredrik-bakke/forest).
}

\p{
The trees below are "collapsed" and can be "expanded" by clicking on them. You can
also search the forest using the search button above or by pressing
\code{Ctrl}+\code{K}.
}

